classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ carry\ no\ JAX-RS\ or\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ carries\ every\ JAX-RS\ and\ Bean\ Validation\ annotation;\ move\ the\ annotation\ from\ XxxResource\ to\ the\ method\ or\ parameter\ on\ XxxApi=f65260e2-62fd-4c46-bd88-45d0cde87c0a
classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ should\ implement\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ named\ after\ them,\ because\ the\ XxxApi\ interface\ is\ the\ contract\:\ declare\ the\ endpoints\ on\ XxxApi\ and\ let\ XxxResource\ implement\ it=48350191-14fd-42aa-bfba-81fad08d1228
classes\ that\ are\ assignable\ to\ java.lang.Throwable\ and\ not\ are\ an\ exception\ mapper\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'io.freedriver.sms.errors',\ because\ the\ module\ keeps\ its\ domain\ exceptions\ in\ one\ package,\ io.freedriver.sms.errors;\ move\ the\ exception\ class\ there=b6d83f92-d886-42d1-ab6a-bbf8b3eb48a1
methods\ that\ are\ declared\ in\ classes\ that\ are\ XxxResource\ classes\ and\ are\ public\ and\ are\ not\ marked\ @ReturnsResponse\ should\ not\ have\ raw\ return\ type\ jakarta.ws.rs.core.Response,\ because\ a\ resource\ method\ returns\ a\ typed\ DTO\ and\ throws\ a\ domain\ exception\ that\ an\ ExceptionMapper\ turns\ into\ a\ status;\ a\ redirect\ or\ stream\ that\ needs\ Response\ carries\ @ReturnsResponse("<reason>");\ declare\ that\ annotation\ once\ in\ this\ module\ as\ @Retention(RUNTIME)\ @Target(METHOD)\ public\ @interface\ ReturnsResponse\ {\ String\ value();\ }=bdbff2c5-bc6a-46f2-84f5-33ead6dd5d99
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.smallrye.faulttolerance.api.RateLimit',\ because\ SmallRye\ @RateLimit\ is\ one\ bucket\ per\ bean\ method,\ not\ per\ caller;\ use\ the\ module's\ per-caller\ limiter\ (@RateLimited\ and\ the\ HitWindow)=c95f9429-61d3-497e-afe1-21ef0718e395
no\ classes\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ any\ package\ ['java.net.http..',\ 'okhttp3..',\ 'org.apache.http..',\ 'org.apache.hc..',\ 'io.vertx.ext.web.client..',\ 'redis.clients.jedis..',\ 'io.lettuce..',\ 'org.redisson..']\ or\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'org.keycloak.admin.client.KeycloakBuilder',\ because\ outgoing\ HTTP\ uses\ a\ REST\ client\ interface\ (or\ sms-client,\ device-daemon),\ Redis\ uses\ the\ Quarkus\ Redis\ client,\ and\ the\ Keycloak\ admin\ client\ is\ the\ one\ the\ Quarkus\ extension\ injects=bdabe815-7c2e-4587-bb79-fccb96cb3adb
no\ classes\ that\ are\ service\ unit\ tests\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ a\ service\ unit\ test\ calls\ the\ service\ and\ asserts\ its\ result\ or\ domain\ exception;\ HTTP\ status\ belongs\ in\ the\ resource's\ @QuarkusTest=8e59fbab-70e2-47bf-a147-8545d0285ae1
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ a\ repository\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'com.mongodb.client..',\ because\ Mongo\ access\ goes\ through\ a\ *Repository\ (a\ PanacheMongoRepository);\ call\ the\ repository\ instead\ of\ the\ Mongo\ driver=dea2fd91-6a5a-46f8-b0f0-5b86681d63f9
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ JAX-RS\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ reside\ in\ a\ package\ 'jakarta.ws.rs..',\ because\ JAX-RS\ belongs\ at\ the\ edge\:\ a\ *Resource,\ *Api,\ *Filter,\ *Mapper(s),\ @Provider\ or\ REST\ client\ interface.\ Throw\ a\ domain\ exception\ and\ map\ it\ to\ a\ status\ in\ the\ module's\ ErrorMappers,\ or\ move\ the\ HTTP\ type\ into\ an\ edge\ class=b3f6b3d6-50b0-40a5-86dc-d90a563ab3a4
no\ classes\ that\ not\ are\ the\ security\ edge\ or\ inside\ one\ should\ depend\ on\ classes\ that\ have\ fully\ qualified\ name\ 'io.quarkus.security.identity.SecurityIdentity',\ because\ the\ identity\ is\ read\ at\ the\ edge\ (a\ *Resource,\ *Filter,\ *Feature,\ MCP\ *Tools\ class,\ identity\ augmentor,\ authentication\ mechanism,\ tenant\ resolver\ or\ tool\ filter);\ pass\ the\ service\ the\ subject\ or\ roles\ it\ needs\ as\ plain\ values=7bac9c8f-1efd-4429-81b4-c2823956d0f8
